{"id":"en_return-for-true-love","title":"Return for true love","titleEn":"Return for true love","description":"In her previous life, Sandy gave her heart to the scholarly Kevin, unaware that he was exploiting her connection to Ethan, the Prince Regent who truly loved her. Kevin had secretly conspired with Sandy's sister Moona, and their scheming ultimately brought about Sandy's tragic end. Granted another chance at life, Sandy resolves to treasure the Regent, sever every harmful bond, and rewrite the destiny that once destroyed her. Those interested can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/return-for-true-love/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/return-for-true-love/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Betrayal","Rebirth","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6mbi/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_return-for-true-love_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6mbi/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_return-for-true-love_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6mbi/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_return-for-true-love_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6mbi/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_return-for-true-love_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6mbi/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_return-for-true-love_5","title":"Episode 5","seaso